+# Tool input validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+The registry validates model-supplied tool input against the registered tool's JSON Schema.
+
+## Contract
+
+- Invalid input is returned as a readable tool result naming the failed property and constraint without exposing values in results or logs; the executor is not called. Valid input, including extra properties, passes to the executor unchanged, and unknown tool names still throw. ([validated by: rejects invalid input without executing or exposing values and passes valid input unchanged](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L14))
+- An invalid static schema fails at registration with an error naming the tool. ([validated by: rejects an invalid static schema when registering its tool](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L50))
+- A function-valued definition is validated against its current schema on each call. ([validated by: validates each call against the current dynamic definition](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L57))
